<title>USA: Moody's raises Wayne County, Mich., GOs to Baa1.</title>
<headline>Moody's raises Wayne County, Mich., GOs to Baa1.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service Inc Friday upgraded Wayne County, Mich., unlimited tax general obligation bonds to Baa1 from Baa, a Moody's analyst said.</p>
<p>The agency confirmed its Baa rating on the county's limited tax general obligation debt, the analyst said.</p>
<p>--Karen Pierog, 312-408-8647</p>
</text>
